write('terminal-race-witnesses.json',dict(status='UNQUALIFIED',scenarios={n:dict(status='UNQUALIFIED' if n in ['W6-A','W6-B','W6-C'] else 'NOT_RUN',native_race_executed=False,authenticated_group=None,external_actor=None,overlap=None,cleanup_winner=None) for n in ['W6-A','W6-B','W6-C','W6-D','W6-E']},controls='lifecycle-witnesses.json: natural final exit and forced retained-owner exit pass 1/2/4, independently; neither is a W6 race',limitation='begin_native_group_exit and final-thread/forced-kill callers hold SCHEDULER. Existing handoff observer does not coordinate contender entry. No safe resumable precommit coordinator or separately authenticated generation-qualified termination actor was installed. Holding a scheduler guard for peer completion would block participants; simultaneous launch is insufficient.',source_references=['kernel/src/sched/native_group.rs:70','kernel/src/sched/mod.rs:4530','kernel/src/arch/x86_64/syscall.rs:392','docs/kernel/kfp-2a6d-concurrent-cleanup-closure.md']))
